  "tempo": 1.12,
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "There is a hard lump molded around your laptop",
      "start": 0.088,
      "end": 2.089
    },
    {
      "text": "charger cable, and",
      "start": 2.198,
      "end": 2.965
    },
    {
      "text": "it is surprisingly heavy for its size.",
      "start": 3.304,
      "end": 4.894
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside it is a ring of ferrite,",
      "start": 5.217,
      "end": 6.771
    },
    {
      "text": "an iron-based ceramic.",
      "start": 6.993,
      "end": 8.173
    },
    {
      "text": "A power cable is a long piece of wire,",
      "start": 8.465,
      "end": 10.484
    },
    {
      "text": "and a long piece of wire is an antenna,",
      "start": 10.728,
      "end": 12.318
    },
    {
      "text": "so it picks up and radiates high-frequency",
      "start": 12.609,
      "end": 14.593
    },
    {
      "text": "noise it was never meant to carry.",
      "start": 14.682,
      "end": 15.985
    },
    {
      "text": "The ferrite ring lets your actual power pass",
      "start": 16.217,
      "end": 18.324
    },
    {
      "text": "straight through,",
      "start": 18.36,
      "end": 18.932
    },
    {
      "text": "and turns that noise into a tiny amount of",
      "start": 19.272,
      "end": 21.131
    },
    {
      "text": "heat.",
      "start": 21.183,
      "end": 21.497
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a filter wrapped around a cable,",
      "start": 21.643,
      "end": 23.521
    },
    {
      "text": "stopping your charger from transmitting.",
      "start": 23.61,
      "end": 25.164
    }
  ],
